---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout
  title="SagaSmith D&D Content Library"
  description="Browse finalized SagaSmith D&D core-rule, addon, module, and preset packages, including actors, sources, assets, review records, and character art."
  page="library"
>
  <main class="public-library-page">
    <header>
      <span>PUBLIC REPOSITORY / CHECKSUM-BOUND / RIGHTS-AWARE</span>
      <h1><span class="zh">SagaSmith 当前内容包目录</span><span class="en">SagaSmith Current Content Pack Catalog</span></h1>
      <p class="zh">仓库与机器可读索引现已公开，统一列出 D&amp;D 5e 与 CoC 7e 的 core rules、Addon、模组和预设。公开可见不等于开放内容许可：每个 Pack、来源与资产仍保留自己的许可、署名和分发限制。请只下载、导入或再分发你有权使用的内容；安装与战役启用仍由 MCP 权限和规则锁控制。</p>
      <p class="en">The repository and machine-readable index are now public, covering current D&amp;D 5e and CoC 7e core rules, addons, modules, and presets. Public visibility is not an open-content license: every Pack, source, and asset retains its own license, attribution, and distribution restrictions. Download, import, or redistribute only what you are authorized to use; MCP permissions and campaign locks still govern installation and activation.</p>
      <div class="library-actions">
        <a href="https://github.com/SagaSmithAI/SagaSmith-dnd-content-library" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="zh">查看公开仓库</span><span class="en">View public repository</span> ↗</a>
        <a href="https://sagasmithai.github.io/SagaSmith-dnd-content-library/content-library/index.json" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="zh">机器可读索引</span><span class="en">Machine-readable index</span> ↗</a>
      </div>
    </header>
    <iframe title="SagaSmith D&D unified content browser" src="https://sagasmithai.github.io/SagaSmith-dnd-content-library/ui/library/" loading="eager"></iframe>
    <noscript><p>JavaScript is required for the package browser. The raw <a href="https://sagasmithai.github.io/SagaSmith-dnd-content-library/content-library/index.json">library index</a> remains available.</p></noscript>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .public-library-page { padding: 120px 24px 50px; }
  .public-library-page > header { width: min(1180px,100%); margin: 0 auto 24px; }
  .public-library-page > header > span { color: #c54b2d; font: 700 11px monospace; letter-spacing: .14em; }
  .public-library-page h1 { margin: 12px 0; font-size: clamp(34px,5vw,68px); }
  .public-library-page p { max-width: 850px; color: #686e68; }
  .library-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; margin-top: 18px; }
  .library-actions a { color: #c54b2d; font: 700 12px monospace; letter-spacing: .06em; text-decoration: none; }
  .library-actions a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  iframe { width: min(1500px,100%); height: max(780px,calc(100vh - 190px)); display: block; margin: 0 auto; border: 1px solid #333a34; background: #f2ede3; }
</style>
